# The Johto Safari Zone: a bright trek in G major for its twelve areas and its gate hall, a marimba's skipping line over
# a bouncing bass, a guitar's off-beat chords and a shaker, with a flute answering in the second half. Original
# composition for this game (plan 20 · J9, part b's leftover; HeartGold gives the zone a song of its own).
